  "bodyHash": "e151d3218bee5d4f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><em>请注意，此模组仍处于早期开发阶段。许多功能仍在积极完善中，您可能会遇到错误或机制不完善的情况。</em></p>\n<p>本模组需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/viltrumite-flight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Viltrumite Flight 1.4.0+</a>，且建议在<strong>第三人称</strong>视角下游玩。<br>按<strong>K</strong>打开能力菜单，按<strong>ALT</strong>切换技能组。将技能拖拽至栏位，或右键点击将其移除。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/baranhan123\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1553010/description_176fb5c0-b4bb-4d43-b29a-20b591c52300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"80\" height=\"25\"></em></a><br><br>雷震<br><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExdXRpczl3cjVldnlxOHJ4amkxNDlqM2kwNW1tbm1mN2x6NzgxNjR1ZyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/4ZFyUiUDbAPQvHiyPZ/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>穿墙飞行</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExaWE1dHBmY2lvNmUwdHM3cHVuMms5bW9qYnIzanNnOGw2bGNkajAwMiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/yDAabhmCaVQZbk2hpb/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>视角：你的朋友嗖地一下化作像素飞走了（你最好赶紧追上他）（悬停状态下按下 DASH + CTRL（疾跑键））</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExeDNtMzBhdDJmaHU4ODVldWdiMnlvNnNnZG42MjJ4em5ibmZ6aGN6NCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/9YUiMDUfCVMUkD4sfi/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>致命劈砍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExYnJibHM4MzN6aHN5azVuMGk2cGh5b3Z0cm1ndDkycTBtMmh0bHJzaSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/7cBPnpCbA9ScoXANJl/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>视角：你的朋友正在向你传授Viltrum的奥义</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExaTdsNmNsYzNnM2g5ZnRrbDAycnBtZzgxMm9xdzZiZms0cXh5aDZzaSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/7fFVDpjYE9S3g0okLO/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>防御控制效果（CC）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExaHJmbTNhYmxlOHhzYTNtemRwMm5rZTVxeHd1b2kwODU5a3U0cHp3aSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/CpJZSvCJHKAtbtFGhD/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>视角：你的朋友正在对着空气挥拳</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExazZzcTdudXRiZGJqYWZhbzFva3l0eTBxNndqMDFpbWIzc29laHpndCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/gKQmIe1CvlQ65eEpx7/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>只是提醒这些弱小而无足轻重的生物，谁才是真正的主宰</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExbmplM25uNnAxY2dieGZrZml3dzdrOGNoOHg2MXd0Y3p6Zjk3YnFpOCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/qCafnpFUd3PF5K2tuN/giphy.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1553010/description_9b694a35-603c-428b-bde4-e6b31f28b94f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"486\" height=\"304\"></p>\n<p><em>（制作中）（界面缩放比例设为最大）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>启动时，若目录为空，该模组会自动在您的 <code>.minecraft</code> 目录下创建 <code>viltrumitetextures</code> 文件夹，并解压默认皮肤（如 skin_omniman_2、skin_lucan 等）与红色披风。您可以添加自定义皮肤和披风，但若希望其他玩家也能看到您的自定义材质，他们同样需要在本地安装对应的材质文件。</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-width:2px\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><strong>指令</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\"><strong>功能说明</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\"><strong>使用权限</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite skin &lt;file name&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">为角色应用指定的模组皮肤。（例如：<code>skin_omniman_2</code>）</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite skin off</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">移除当前皮肤，恢复原始外观。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite cape &lt;file name&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">为角色装备披风。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite cape off</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">移除披风。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite model default</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">将角色模型设置为标准（粗臂）体型。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite model slim</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">将角色模型设置为纤细（细臂）体型。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite power</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">赋予执行指令的玩家Viltrum之力。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">OP（管理员）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite power &lt;player&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">赋予指定玩家Viltrum之力。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">OP（管理员）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite depower</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">移除执行指令玩家的Viltrum之力。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">OP（管理员）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:31.1157%\"><code>/viltrumite depower &lt;player&gt;</code></td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:54.1718%\">移除指定玩家的Viltrum之力。</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:2px;width:14.45%\">OP（管理员）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>",
